# Port-only: at 640x400 (>= 10% over 320x200 on both axes) a screen is drawn
# over the live map, centred at (160,100), and a left click outside it closes it.
# The test ends on the main map only if every outside click closed its screen.
screen 640 400
gap 20
key F3                     # Continental Congress report
click 20 20                # outside: closes it outright (Esc would page on)
key e                      # Europe
click 20 380               # outside: closes it
click 368 216              # open Quebec (map tile 45,24, view origin 22,11)
rclick 400 150             # area tile: terrain pedia, returns to the colony
click 600 380              # outside: closes the pedia, back in Quebec
click 600 20               # outside: closes the colony screen
